@startuml sequence-doctor-profile
' Sequence Diagram Profil Dokter (Doctor Profile) - PIXEL-T

title Sequence Diagram Profil Dokter (Doctor Profile) - PIXEL-T

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline false
skinparam roundcorner 5

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #DCE9F7
  BorderColor #2E5E9E
  FontColor #172B4D
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #2E5E9E
  FontColor #172B4D
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #DCE9F7
  BorderColor #2E5E9E
  FontColor #172B4D
}
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2E5E9E
  LifeLineBorderColor #2E5E9E
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #EEF5FC
  GroupBorderColor #2E5E9E
  GroupBackgroundColor #EEF5FC
  GroupHeaderFontColor #172B4D
}

actor "Dokter / Tenaga Medis" as User
participant "Halaman Doctor Profile\n(React)" as Profile
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
participant "Flask API\n+ AnalysisService" as API
database "Supabase Database" as Database
participant "Supabase Storage" as Storage

User -> Profile: Membuka /profile

par Memuat profil
  Profile -> Database: Baca doctor_profiles\nberdasarkan user_id (RLS)
  alt Data profil tersedia
    Database --> Profile: Data profil
  else Data tidak tersedia / query gagal
    Database --> Profile: Tidak ada data / error
    Profile -> Profile: Gunakan metadata user\nsebagai fallback
  end
else Memuat aktivitas
  Profile -> API: GET /api/history\n(access token)
  API -> Auth: Verifikasi token
  Auth --> API: User terautentikasi
  API -> Database: Ambil maksimal 20 riwayat terbaru
  Database --> API: Daftar riwayat
  opt Untuk riwayat bergambar
    API -> Storage: Buat signed URL thumbnail
    Storage --> API: URL thumbnail
  end
  API --> Profile: Daftar riwayat
  Profile -> Profile: Hitung statistik dan pilih\n3 riwayat terbaru
end
Profile --> User: Tampilkan profil dan aktivitas

opt Mengedit profil
  User -> Profile: Pilih Edit Profile
  Profile --> User: Tampilkan form 5 tab\nPersonal, Professional, Education,\nExperience, Bio
  User -> Profile: Ubah data dan pilih Simpan
  Profile -> Profile: Validasi data

  alt Data tidak valid
    Profile --> User: Tampilkan pesan validasi
  else Data valid
    Profile -> Database: Upsert doctor_profiles\n(onConflict: user_id)
    Database --> Profile: Hasil upsert
    Profile -> Auth: updateUser(full_name,\ndoctor_profile)
    Auth --> Profile: Hasil pembaruan metadata

    alt Minimal satu penyimpanan berhasil
      Profile -> Profile: Perbarui tampilan profil
      Profile --> User: Tampilkan pesan berhasil
    else Kedua penyimpanan gagal
      Profile --> User: Tampilkan pesan gagal menyimpan
    end
  end
end

note over Profile,Database
  Profil dibaca dan disimpan langsung dari frontend
  melalui Supabase client, bukan melalui Flask API.
end note

@enduml
